History: chromium.db from the sootmark-browser repository
(tests/fixtures/recovery/, made by sootmark-sqlite's recovery generator with the
sqlite3 shell): a Chromium-like history with a time range of visits cleared.
MIT OR Apache-2.0, like this crate.
wal/History and wal/History-wal: from the sootmark-browser repository
(tests/fixtures/recovery/gen.sh): a Chromium history whose deleted visits
survive only in its write-ahead log. MIT OR Apache-2.0.
